cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "AT-SOTA Prominence Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A divide-consistent, seamless QGIS/GRASS/SAGA workflow that computes national
  topographic prominence directly on a raster digital terrain model and certifies
  Summits on the Air (SOTA) candidates for Austria at the 150 m prominence
  threshold. The core contribution is PixelMinimax, a pixel-level descending
  Union-Find algorithm.
type: software
